    "description": "星辰会议室：让分散在不同会话里的 AI 坐进同一间房开会 —— 主持人开房定题，按序邀请成员逐一发言，轮次用满即收会出纪要。 LittleStar Meeting Room: bring AI sessions that cannot see each other into one room — one host sets the topic, members speak in turn, and the meeting ends with written minutes."
